cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the repository."
title: "compbio-claim-inflation: ground truth, detector and red/blue harness for inflation in computational-biology claims"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "compbio-claim-inflation contributors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/w23x0/compbio-claim-inflation"
keywords:
  - computational biology
  - reproducibility
  - claim inflation
  - red teaming
  - survival analysis
abstract: >-
  A harness that re-analyses public cancer cohorts to measure how inflated a
  published prognostic claim is, trains a content-only detector on those
  labels, and runs an isolated red-team / blue-team loop against the detector.
